docs {
  # Send Friendship Request (`SendFriendshipRequest`)
  
  **Handler**: `handlers.SendFriendshipRequest` in [friendship_handler.go](file:///d:/Codes/budget-tracker/go-server/handlers/friendship_handler.go)
  **Route**: `POST /api/_private/v1/friendships/send` (Private - Bearer Token required)
  
  ### Description
  Sends a friend connection invite to another user by their registered email:
  - Looks up target user by `email`.
  - Verifies user is not attempting to friend themselves.
  - Checks if a friendship or pending request already exists in either direction.
  - Stores a new `Friendship` with `Status = "PENDING"` (convention: `UserID = Receiver`, `FriendID = Sender`).
  - Broadcasts a real-time WebSocket notification (`FRIEND_REQUEST_RECEIVED`) to the recipient.
  
  ### Body
  - `email` (string, required): Registered email of the friend.
}
